<title>USA: QPQ slips after striking Mexican glove deal.</title>
<headline>QPQ slips after striking Mexican glove deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>QPQ Inc shares fell almost 20 percent on Monday in the wake of the company's announcement that it would buy Mexico's largest latex glove maker in a stock deal.</p>
<p>QPQ shares fell 1/2 to 2-1/8.</p>
<p>Terms of the purchase of Vitex SA de CV were not disclosed.  Vitex controls over half of the Mexican latex glove market, QPQ said.</p>
</text>
